#. i18n: file ./firstrunwizard.ui line 308
#: rc.cpp:124
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A database is needed by amaroK to store information about your "
"<b>Collection</b>. If your not sure what that means, do not worry as the "
"default is <b>sqlite</b> and requires no configuration. <b>MySQL or "
"Postgresql</b> are faster, but require additional setup. Detailed "
"instructions for configuring MySQL are at the <a "
"href=\"http://amarok.kde.org/wiki/index.php/MySQL_HowTo\">amaroK wiki</a>. "
